data: {"id": "41732ca3239a40e8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1259", "run_id": "41732ca3239a40e8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已对 `aiops-case-v08/workload` 完成首轮证据采集，事实梳理如下：\n\n### 已采集事实（支持/确认候选原因）\n1. **Pod 生命周期状态（kubectl_get_yaml + describe）**：\n   - Phase 为 `Running`，但条件显示 `Ready=False`、`ContainersReady=False`，消息为 `containers with unready status: [app]`。\n   - 容器 `app` 的 `reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`exitCode=127`，`restarts=11`，消息包含 `back-off 5m0s restarting failed container`。\n   - **关键配置**：`command: sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command`。exitCode 127 典型为\"命令未找到\"。\n\n2. **崩溃前日志（kubectl_previous_logs）**：\n   - 返回唯一关键行：`sh: exec:", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789133934242, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

