data: {"id": "41732ca3239a40e8-final", "run_id": "41732ca3239a40e8", "seq": 1264, "ts_ms": 1789133951657, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | aiops-case-v08/workload Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器 app 反复退出。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | K8s API | `container.last_exit_code: 127` | 确认应用进程因“未找到命令”直接崩溃退出 |\n| 2 | Logging | ElasticSearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | 捕获到进程启动失败的明确错误，支撑 Root Cause |\n| 3 | K8s State | K8s API | `container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff` | 展示容器因反复异常退出进入重启退避状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (current: 11, window: 6-11) | 量化了 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的频繁重启现象 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nK8s 层面的 exit code 127（事实 #1）与日志中的 `not found` 报错（事实 #2）完全一致，共同锁定了“可执行文件缺失”为直接崩溃原因。Metric 提供的 11 次重启（事实 #4）解释了为何 K8s 当前处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态（事实 #3）而非立即 Restarting。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n镜像中缺少 /opt/app/unavailable-command 文件 → 容器启动执行 command 'sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command' 失败 → 容器进程以 exit code 127 退出并进入 CrashLoopBackOff → Pod 状态持续为 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为镜像中指定的可执行文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 不存在。该文件的缺失导致应用容器无法启动，进程以 `exit code 127`（命令未找到）退出，进而触发 Kubernetes 的 CrashLoopBackOff 机制 [事实 #1, #2, #3]。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v08/workload: 44.1s (Evidence 33.6s, RCA 10.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v08/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 71.783, "metrics": {"run_id": "41732ca3239a40e8", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 71.78980088233948, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 71789.80088233948, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 67686.3386631012, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 10054.836750030518, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3798.7663745880127}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20772.87983894348, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 44116.19973182678, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6880.28883934021, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

